    intro:"A Freetown R&B and Afropop singer who records under her own Sokota Vybe name.",
    bio:["Rozzy Sokota makes R&B, Afropop and what she calls Afrosounds, recording under the Sokota Vybe name. She released an album titled SokotaVybe.","She has worked with I-Tribe, Markmuday, Blesz, Kracktwist, Samza and Arkman, including “Abandawa” with Arkman.","She has been named among the 50 Most Influential Sierra Leonean Women."],
    facts:[["Label","Sokota Vybe"],["Known for","“Abandawa” ft. Arkman"]], awards:["Named among the 50 Most Influential Sierra Leonean Women"],
